<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan central bank board to meet on October 17.</title>
<headline>Taiwan central bank board to meet on October 17.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank plans to hold a delayed meeting of its board of directors on October 17, a central bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The central bank had postponed its scheduled September 12 board meeting as several members were unable to attend.</p>
<p>The bank had then said it planned to review during the meeting a proposal to set a direction to lower banks' reserve requirements and raise the liquidity ratio.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
